<title>USA: Boston Scientific Q3 sales rise.</title>
<headline>Boston Scientific Q3 sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>NATICK, Mass. 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boston Scientific Corp said third quarter net sales were $374 million, up 32 percent from last year's $283 million.</p>
</text>
